MIAMA's console styling and browser interactions are adapted from ABFlow's
H.A.W.T.O.W.N console (abfe/console_assets and abfe/console/runs.py).
Source: /biggin/b211/reub0138/Projects/orexin/abflow_git/abflow
The adapted console has been simplified for manual YAML data and rebranded MIAMA.
The source project's GNU GPL version 3 is retained in LICENSE.

Inter and JetBrains Mono are bundled with their original licence notices in
assets/Inter-LICENSE.txt and assets/JetBrainsMono-LICENSE.txt. Their notices are
also embedded in the generated HTML.

